[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691075394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691075394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691075394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gZo1C","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T16:31:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T16:31:35Z","body":"Looks good, but wouldn't it make sense to go once step above and avoid registering ProgressDialog steps in headless mode? Or would that add significant complexity to the implementation?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691075394/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691230066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691230066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691230066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gaOly","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T17:51:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T17:52:00Z","body":"That sounds interesting, but I'm not sure I understand exactly what you mean by `avoid registering ProgressDialog steps`. Do you mean not creating the `ProgressDialog` instance in EditorNode, moving the condition in `EditorProgress::EditorProgress` or avoiding all the calls to `EditorProgress` in `EditorNode`?? Or something else??","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691230066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691334554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691334554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691334554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gaoGa","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T18:51:52Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T18:52:23Z","body":"> Progress dialogs are not useful when nothing is displayed, so I skipped the ProgressDialog code when using `--headless` by checking `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_can_draw()`.\r\n\r\nNote that we could technically support displaying progress dialogs in headless mode, but it would likely involve something like [ncurses](https://invisible-island.net/ncurses/announce.html) which would bring a lot of added complexity for limited benefit. Not to mention it wouldn't play well with CI where progress reporting should be purely non-interactive.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691334554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691340262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691340262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691340262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gapfm","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T18:55:17Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T18:55:17Z","body":"> > Progress dialogs are not useful when nothing is displayed, so I skipped the ProgressDialog code when using `--headless` by checking `DisplayServer::get_singleton()->window_can_draw()`.\r\n> \r\n> Note that we could technically support displaying progress dialogs in headless mode, but it would likely involve something like [ncurses](https://invisible-island.net/ncurses/announce.html) which would bring a lot of added complexity for limited benefit. Not to mention it wouldn't play well with CI where progress reporting should be purely non-interactive.\r\n\r\nYeah I wouldn't add that, `--headless` is first and foremost meant for CI / server use, so non-interactive.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691340262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691344620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691344620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691344620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gaqjs","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T18:57:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T18:57:24Z","body":"> That sounds interesting, but I'm not sure I understand exactly what you mean by `avoid registering ProgressDialog steps`. Do you mean not creating the `ProgressDialog` instance in EditorNode, moving the condition in `EditorProgress::EditorProgress` or avoiding all the calls to `EditorProgress` in `EditorNode`?? Or something else??\r\n\r\nI meant not creating any `EditorProgress` in `EditorNode` when headless mode is enabled. But checking https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93064 I see that it would add a lot of boilerplate. The way you did it is probably the simplest.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691344620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691348784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691348784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691348784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6garkw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T18:59:50Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T19:01:08Z","body":"Actually, I was confusing `EditorProgress` and `ProgressDialog`. Looking at the code of `EditorProgress`, it seems already designed to not use `ProgressDialog` on command line:\r\n```\r\nbool EditorNode::progress_task_step(const String &p_task, const String &p_state, int p_step, bool p_force_refresh) {\r\n\tif (!singleton) {\r\n\t\treturn false;\r\n\t} else if (singleton->cmdline_export_mode) {\r\n\t\tprint_line(\"\\t\" + p_task + \": step \" + itos(p_step) + \": \" + p_state);\r\n\t\treturn false;\r\n\t} else if (singleton->progress_dialog) {\r\n\t\treturn singleton->progress_dialog->task_step(p_task, p_state, p_step, p_force_refresh);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\treturn false;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe might just need to change the condition there.\r\n\r\nThe `cmdline_export_mode` boolean is also responsible for *not* starting EditorResourcePreview, which is likely also something we'd like to avoid for `--import`. So I think this should be refactored to encompass more use cases.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691348784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691438955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691438955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691438955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gbBlr","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T19:54:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T19:54:26Z","body":"I updated the PR with a new suggestion renaming `cmdline_export_mode` for `cmdline_mode` and reusing it in headless mode.\r\n\r\nI looked to place the condition directly into `EditorProgress` but I saw that `EditorNode::progress_add_task` is called directly from `godot_icall_EditorProgress_Create` in `editor_internal_calls`.\r\n\r\nThis proposed version has the advantage of displaying the progress in the output console, exactly how it was done when exporting from command line:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4a68169-e7a9-43b2-8bff-fdffb699f1b7)\r\n\r\nAnd we can also see that there's a couple of useless steps in headless mode, but there's already an issue for that: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103305\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691438955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691512532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2691512532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2691512532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gbTjU","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T20:42:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T20:42:32Z","body":"It sounds like this would supersede my old PR to some degree: #90806","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691512532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695874584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2695874584","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2695874584,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gr8gY","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T00:24:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T00:24:51Z","body":"Just fixed merge conflict.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2695874584/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701704937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2701704937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2701704937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCL7p","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:09:29Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701704937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706366202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2706366202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2706366202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hT976","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:44:17Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:46:00Z","body":"@Hilderin I haven't looked into this too deeply, but the exact error that this issue fixes for headless can also be seen when minimizing the editor while it's starting up, as mentioned by another user [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2705248413), even when using the fix from this PR.\r\n\r\nGiven that the user has narrowed down the regression to have been introduced between 4.4-dev1 and 4.4-dev2 I assume it's largely the same issue, but I haven't bisected the exact commit.\r\n\r\nI'm guessing `DisplayServer::window_can_draw` isn't sufficient to capture the case where the `DisplayServer` can actually draw but isn't able to (if that's even a thing)? Would we even want `cmdline_mode` in those cases?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706366202/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706391150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2706391150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2706391150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUEBu","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:54:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:54:59Z","body":"> I'm guessing `DisplayServer::window_can_draw` isn't sufficient to capture the case where the `DisplayServer` can actually draw but isn't able to (if that's even a thing)? Would we even want `cmdline_mode` in those cases?\r\n\r\nThen maybe @Riteo is right in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403/files#diff-b88f0bde58b731e8dd353707c8011fb7a1e452f0db2c9f15f4b7905d60e5e52e and we should switch all those to explicitly check for `headless`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706391150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706430793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2706430793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2706430793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUNtJ","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T13:15:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T13:15:18Z","body":"To clarify, I'm saying that this fix is missing a case of this regression, since it doesn't seem to fix the case where we're not headless, but the window is instead just minimized. So the fix introduced by this PR likely needs to be altered or supplemented to encompass that.\r\n\r\nSwitching to what @Riteo suggested (which might still be warranted) would not resolve this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706430793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707554245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2707554245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2707554245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hYf_F","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T22:03:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T22:03:10Z","body":"@mihe\r\n\r\n> Switching to what @Riteo suggested (which might still be warranted) would not resolve this.\r\n\r\nActually, I think it would :P\r\n\r\nMost desktop platforms implement `window_can_draw` as \"is the window minimized\", so the minimized bug is indeed related to my concern.\r\n\r\nThe Wayland backend implements it as \"is the window suspended\" (which is the ideal implementation for said method actually) and that's why (at least, haven't checked in a while) the new multiwindow Wayland PR always prints this error, as the rendering times out during loading and flags the window as suspended.\r\n\r\n`window_can_draw` is what's used for detecting whether it's worth to draw in the first place, eventually skipping to a separate tickrate and turning off the rendering loop if all windows can't be drawn, along other things.\r\n\r\nThat's why I think that checking for the DS name instead of `window_can_draw` should fix the issue for the minimized case.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707554245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708364160","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2708364160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2708364160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hbluA","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T15:50:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T15:51:02Z","body":"> That's why I think that checking for the DS name instead of `window_can_draw` should fix the issue for the minimized case.\r\n\r\nI'm confused. I was under the impression that this PR fixed the issue of headless imports because it was made to piggyback on what was previously called `cmdline_export_mode`, but is now just called `cmdline_mode`, which lets us skip all the progress dialog stuff that causes the errors to be emitted, as seen here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b5bdb88062a31a982c8f3bf4b820188edd53c6c5/editor/editor_node.cpp#L4995-L5003\r\n\r\nSo switching out the `DisplayServer::window_can_draw()` check that this PR introduced, for a more explicit headless check, would presumably result in _less_ cases being encompassed by this change (which, again, might be warranted for other reasons). The issue with errors being emitted when minimizing the editor on startup (as reported [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2705248413)) is not a regression from this PR, it's a yet-to-be-fixed regression from #93064.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708364160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708458372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2708458372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2708458372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hb8uE","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-08T19:29:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T19:29:01Z","body":"> The issue with errors being emitted when minimizing the editor on startup (as reported https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100900#issuecomment-2705248413) is not a regression from this PR, it's a yet-to-be-fixed regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93064.\r\n\r\nMh. TBF I don't know the whole flow of that class. Thing is, it's very suspicious that the issue arises when minimized as it exactly coincides with the return value of `window_can_draw`.\r\n\r\nI do 100% agree that this PR does not fix all issues, as there might be a core issue throughout the whole codebase regarding this heuristic, and I don't think that changing just that check would fix the issue. My comment was about the whole package.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if this clears everything up, sorry for not catching up what you mean.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708458372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2717550567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103403#issuecomment-2717550567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103403","id":2717550567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h-ofn","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T11:24:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T11:24:35Z","body":"Cherry-picked for 4.4.1.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2717550567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]